src: 7 files/193 lines. Cargo lib-only, no main.rs, no bin, no tests dir, no deps. unused.rs has dead_code_helper_alpha/beta + actively_used_helper(no refs seen yet).
## Learnings
`);
print(NOTE, RUN_TMP);","language":"js","summary":"Create notepad and run temp dir"}

{"code":"const sh = async (c)=> (await Bun.$`sh -c ${c}`.nothrow().text());
const fns = (await sh(`grep -rhoE 'fn [a-z_0-9]+' src | awk '{print $2}' | sort -u`)).trim().split('\n');
